comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-23T19:19:34.282Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all-status PM work for nightly timeout, Nightly Validation and coverage/static quality; pm-2zjs0g owns recurrence measurement and pm-ehbb completed alerting, but neither owns this serial Ubuntu Node 24 job-budget failure. Run 35905763390 passed coverage and reached mutation before the 20-minute cap canceled static. Reuse pm-u9d0 CI parent and link the discovery lineage."
  "2026-09-23T19:22:52.261Z","harness:codex","Implementation: split Nightly Validation Ubuntu Node 24 into a coverage matrix leg and a separate 20-minute quality job. The quality job retains version check, secret scan, fresh build, clone merge-driver setup, full static quality, compatibility gate and scheduled failure alert. Platform legs retain typecheck and full test/coverage. Workflow contract test 15/15, typecheck passed. The canceled run 35905763390 reached mutation after coverage before its serial budget expired; no assertion failure. Local static components after host-sensitive benchmark rechecks: SDK import cost 10/10, CLI transport floor 6/6, graph composition, record integrity, mutation 323 killed plus seven classified equivalent. Hosted all-job proof pending."
